\caption{
\textbf{Text-response entanglement and source-supported re-ranking.}
Raw on-axis scoring strongly overlaps true defects with hard false positives.
The orthogonal residual improves defect-vs-hard-FP separation in this case, but weakens separation from generic outside regions.
The source-supported margin re-ranks the same responses while preserving strong outside separation, showing that TED decomposes rather than discards the text-guided response.
}
\label{fig:discuss2}

